                                    <h1>Jewelry D2C Case Study &amp;mdash; How ITD Scaled a Brand with Numbers (2026) | ITD GrowthLabs</h1>
                                    <div style="background:#fff7ed;border-left:4px solid #ff5722;padding:20px 24px;border-radius:10px;margin:24px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:#334155;"><strong style="color:#ea580c;font-size:14px;letter-spacing:0.4px;">ITD JEWELRY PORTFOLIO &mdash; THE EVIDENCE:</strong><br>This article is written from live jewelry vertical work. ITD GrowthLabs is a specialist <a href="/industries/digital-marketing-for-jewelry-brands.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">digital marketing agency for jewelry brands</a> with a delivered <a href="/resources/Fabelia_Jewelry_D2C_Marketing_Strategy_Case_Study_2026.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">Fabelia jewelry D2C case study</a>, 8+ published jewelry playbooks including <a href="/resources/Gold_vs_Diamond_Jewelry_D2C_Strategy_2026.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">Gold vs Diamond D2C Strategy</a>, <a href="/resources/Jewelry_D2C_Digital_Transformation_India_Dubai_2026.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">Jewelry D2C Digital Transformation India + Dubai</a>, <a href="/resources/Best_D2C_Jewellery_Brands_UAE_GCC_2026_2027.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">Best D2C Jewellery Brands UAE + GCC</a>, and city-specific jewelry marketing pages across <a href="/services/gcc/dubai-jewellery-agency.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">Dubai</a>, <a href="/services/gcc/abu-dhabi-jewellery-agency.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">Abu Dhabi</a>, <a href="/services/gcc/jeddah-jewellery-agency.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">Jeddah</a>, <a href="/services/gcc/doha-jewellery-agency.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">Doha</a>, <a href="/services/gcc/dammam-jewellery-agency.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">Dammam</a>, and <a href="/services/gcc/al-khobar-jewellery-agency.php" style="color:#ea580c;font-weight:700;">Al Khobar</a>. Every framework below is grounded in live category work &mdash; not generic D2C theory.</div><p>Vetting a jewelry marketing agency deserves real case-study evidence &mdash; not just "we work with jewelry brands" claims. This page summarises ITD's anchor jewelry engagement (Fabelia D2C) + walks through the engagement structure + phases + deliverables + marketing stack + measurable outcomes.</p><p>Full case study with detailed metrics + client references available under NDA on discovery call. This piece is the public-facing summary.</p>
                                    <h2>Fabelia D2C jewelry engagement &amp;mdash; overview</h2>
                                    <p><strong>Client:</strong> Fabelia (D2C jewelry brand).</p><p><strong>Engagement scope:</strong> Full-stack D2C marketing including brand strategy + positioning + Shopify optimisation + Google + Meta + Instagram + WhatsApp funnel + content + SEO + influencer + calendar-aware campaign planning.</p><p><strong>Geography:</strong> India-first, GCC expansion planning.</p><p><strong>Sub-vertical:</strong> Fine + fashion + occasion jewelry.</p><p><strong>Full case study:</strong> <a href="/resources/Fabelia_Jewelry_D2C_Marketing_Strategy_Case_Study_2026.php">Fabelia Jewelry D2C Marketing Strategy Case Study</a>.</p>
                                    <h2>Phase 1 &amp;mdash; Discovery + strategy foundation</h2>
                                    <p><strong>Timeline:</strong> Weeks 1-3.</p><p><strong>Deliverables:</strong></p><ul style="padding-left:20px;line-height:1.9;"><li>Brand positioning + audience + competitive landscape workshop</li><li>Sub-vertical clarification + primary buyer persona definition</li><li>Shopify + apps + funnel + attribution audit</li><li>Content library + SEO baseline assessment</li><li>Meta + Google account audit + creative + attribution methodology review</li><li>WhatsApp + retention + wishlist infrastructure review</li><li>Compliance status (BIS + HUID + certification display) review</li><li>30-page growth diagnostic + 90-day plan document</li></ul>
                                    <h2>Phase 2 &amp;mdash; Foundation build (Week 4-8)</h2>
                                    <p><strong>Deliverables:</strong></p><ul style="padding-left:20px;line-height:1.9;"><li>Shopify optimisation + AR try-on integration + video consultation booking widget setup</li><li>BIS + HUID + certification display on all SKU pages</li><li>WhatsApp Cloud API + Interakt setup + booking + tracking + broadcast flows</li><li>Klaviyo + review app + wishlist app + shipping insurance integration</li><li>Meta Pixel + Conversion API + Google GA4 + attribution + iOS 14+ ATT setup</li><li>SEO schema (Product + Organization + LocalBusiness + FAQPage + BreadcrumbList) deployment</li><li>Content library initial 20-25 pieces (buying guides + comparison + occasion)</li><li>Photography + video refresh for existing SKUs (macro + 360 + on-model)</li><li>Landing pages for Google + Meta campaigns + CRO baseline</li></ul>
                                    <h2>Phase 3 &amp;mdash; Launch + campaigns (Week 7-10)</h2>
                                    <p><strong>Deliverables:</strong></p><ul style="padding-left:20px;line-height:1.9;"><li>Google Search + Shopping + PMax campaigns live with jewelry-specific structure</li><li>Meta Advantage+ Shopping + Conversions + Click-to-WhatsApp + Retargeting campaigns live</li><li>Instagram organic content pod ramping (12 posts + 8 Reels / week)</li><li>Pinterest boards + pinning cadence established</li><li>Influencer casting + first-wave 5-10 micro-creator collabs</li><li>Calendar-aware campaign planning for Dhanteras + Akshaya Tritiya + wedding season</li><li>Weekly reporting + monthly QBR cadence established</li><li>First landing page A/B tests running</li></ul>
                                    <h2>Phase 4 &amp;mdash; Optimise + scale (Month 3+)</h2>
                                    <p><strong>Deliverables:</strong></p><ul style="padding-left:20px;line-height:1.9;"><li>Weekly Meta + Google + Instagram optimisation cadence</li><li>Creative refresh (15-30 new creatives / week) + Reels production ramp</li><li>UGC + creator content amplification into paid + Meta Branded Content Partner whitelisting</li><li>WhatsApp broadcast segmentation + retention flows optimisation</li><li>Content library growth (6-8 pieces / month + case study amplification)</li><li>SEO silo pages building + organic ranking + traffic growth</li><li>Wedding + festive + peak-season campaign launches</li><li>Attribution + LTV / CAC / cohort reporting mature</li></ul><p><strong>Outcomes:</strong> Detailed metrics available under NDA. Directional outcomes: material revenue growth + ROAS + repeat rate + brand-search lift + WhatsApp NRR growth over the engagement period.</p>
                                    <h2>How to see the full case study + engagement details</h2>
                                    <p>Full Fabelia case study with detailed metrics + specific channel + creative + attribution outcomes available:</p><ul style="padding-left:20px;line-height:1.9;"><li><strong>Public case study page:</strong> <a href="/resources/Fabelia_Jewelry_D2C_Marketing_Strategy_Case_Study_2026.php">Fabelia Jewelry D2C Marketing Strategy Case Study</a> &mdash; the published case study document.</li><li><strong>Detailed metrics under NDA:</strong> Full closed-won revenue + LTV + CAC + cohort + attribution + specific creative + channel metrics available on discovery call under NDA.</li><li><strong>Additional jewelry client references:</strong> Available on discovery call. Talk directly to past + current jewelry clients about delivery quality + attribution honesty + team.</li></ul><p>Book a 30-minute Calendly discovery call via our <a href="/industries/digital-marketing-for-jewelry-brands.php">jewelry vertical page</a> for full case study review + additional reference introductions + how our engagement approach applies to your specific brand + sub-vertical + geography.</p>

