                                        <p>Month 3+: weekly Meta + Google + Instagram optimisation, creative refresh (15-30 new / week), UGC + creator content amplification + Meta Branded Content Partner whitelisting, WhatsApp broadcast segmentation + retention flows optimisation, content library growth (6-8 pieces / month + case study amplification), SEO silo pages + organic ranking + traffic growth, wedding + festive + peak-season campaigns, attribution + LTV / CAC / cohort reporting mature.</p>
